  "bio": "Nestled in the creative heart of East London, Kindred Tattoo offers a sanctuary of artistic expression for both skin and canvas. Specializing in the intricate shades of black & gray and meticulous dotwork, this studio blends the timeless craft of tattooing with a vibrant art gallery space, embodying the #kindredfamily spirit through a shared passion for ink, art sales, and bespoke commissions. Whether you're seeking a piercing, a unique tattoo, or to immerse yourself in graphic design and graffiti, Kindred Tattoo is a hub for enthusiasts and artists at local conventions and bespoke events.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: London, England, United Kingdom"
